      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "ON TARGET (8) has a terrific record this trip with two wins and two placings from four starts. Scored by 3.5 lengths last time (21.91) in a Maiden over 380m at this track. Rates a leading player. UTAH SAINT (7) drew an outside box and was game in defeat when only 1.75 lengths from the winner Swanky Franky in second(22.34) at this track. Yet to win out of this box but has been in the placings two times from three starts. Bold showing expected. SALLY SAID (3) was below best last time finishing eighth at this track, but prior to that had been racing well including a Maiden win two back at this track. Can improve sharply here. MUPPET CENTRAL (1) should bounce back after an unplaced effort here recently.",
